Subject: [PATCH] gh-119710: fix asyncio Process.wait() to finish on process
 exit and not wait for closing of pipes (#151983)

Co-authored-by: Kumar Aditya <kumaraditya@python.org>
---
 Lib/asyncio/base_subprocess.py                | 25 +++----
 Lib/test/test_asyncio/test_subprocess.py      | 71 +++++++++++--------
 ...-06-11-10-00-00.gh-issue-119710.Qz7Kp2.rst |  4 ++
 3 files changed, 53 insertions(+), 47 deletions(-)
